  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-model.c007': "Method: one row = one swimlane (not a dish); the question is when this resource is free. The critical path gets its own row, numbered from 1. Idle segments are drawn as dotted blocks with their minutes written in, never pretending to be occupied.",
  /* ── packages/base-render/src/components/gantt-timeline/style-marks.ts（#1226 迁入） ── */
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c001': "/* One segment: the glyph is centred; when there is a short label the label follows (wraps inside the bar when long, never truncated). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c002': "/* Done: secondary surface + hairline border (one tier weaker). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c003': "/* Waiting on a prerequisite: secondary surface + dashed border + `⋯` (**different shape**, not colour alone). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c004': "/* Not started: paper + dashed border + `▷` (the hollow triangle pairs with the solid one of in-progress). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c005': '/* Critical path: the **sequence number inside the segment is body-level text** ⇒ per the rule table it counts as "a selected surface with text": soft fill + primary text + primary outline',
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c006': "   (the solid tier does not clear the 4.5 text floor under the neutral skin). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c007': "/* A segment with a short label (`is-labelled`): **this surface carries body-level text** ⇒ same tier as the critical-path segment (soft fill + primary text + outline).",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c008': '   The in-progress bar is solid **only without a short label** (it carries just a glyph like `▶`, the "selected surface without text" case);',
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c009': "   once it has a short label, `accent-ink` on the solid fill is only 4.02 under the neutral skin, and body text does not clear 4.5. */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c010': "/* Idle segment: a dotted block + the minutes inside it (**never pretends to be occupied**: not a solid fill, not a state colour). */",
  'base-render.components-gantt-timeline-style-marks.c011': "/* Milestone: the element spans one side and the `◆` sits on the gridline; the name is written beside it (wraps when long). */",
